{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"拟分离概形"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"拟分离概形"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>满足如下等价条件的概形 $X$ 称为<strong>拟分离</strong> (quasi-separated) 概形:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ 的任意两个仿射开集的交均为"},{"Local":{"url":"拟紧概形","text":"拟紧概形"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"对角线","text":"对角线"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta_X\\colon X\\to X\\times X$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"拟紧态射","text":"拟紧态射"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p>拟分离概形的"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对"}},{"Plain":"版本是"},{"Local":{"url":"拟分离态射","text":"拟分离态射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}